#
# lib_code, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): code as the object,
# whatever its language: Highlight_code (mini-emacs's highlighters'
# categories) and the SSA form's algorithms, Dominators, Braun, Liveness
# and Coloring, which mini-ml's and mini-cc's ssa/ share. Each program
# compiled them itself before, from here (a rule in each mkfile), each
# an object of its own (plan_simpler_builds.md, step 4).
TOP=..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=lib_code
DIRS=.
NEEDS=
UNITS=Highlight_code Dominators Braun Liveness Coloring
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
